  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Cage Farm - tilapia production in Ghana</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A project partnership is formed between two Norwegian companies, Oxyvision As and Norwegian Lobster Farm As, to develop production of tilapia in Ghana. The project is based on high standards of systems and practices with quality fingerlings and improvement of the productivity by turning over by faster by higher value input to its production.</narrative>
  </description>
